QUESTION 12: INSUREEASY – ONLINE INSURANCE MANAGEMENT WEBSITE
AIM
To develop an online insurance management website using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript that allows users to view insurance policies, calculate premiums, and manage their insurance details.
ALGORITHM
1. Start the program.
2. Create an HTML page containing insurance policy options and a premium calculator.
3. Apply CSS to style the page and policy cards.
4. Use JavaScript to display available insurance policies.
5. Allow users to select a policy and enter the required amount.
6. Calculate the estimated premium based on the selected policy.
7. Display the premium and confirmation message.
8. Stop the program.
HTML CODE — index.html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>InsureEasy</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>InsureEasy</h1>
        <p>Your Protection, Our Priority</p>
    </header>

    <main>
        <h2>Available Insurance Policies</h2>

        <div class="policies">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Health Insurance</h3>
                <p>Annual premium rate: 2%</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Vehicle Insurance</h3>
                <p>Annual premium rate: 3%</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Home Insurance</h3>
                <p>Annual premium rate: 1%</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <section class="calculator">
            <h2>Premium Calculator</h2>

            <label for="policy">Select Policy:</label>
            <select id="policy">
                <option value="health">Health Insurance</option>
                <option value="vehicle">Vehicle Insurance</option>
                <option value="home">Home Insurance</option>
            </select>

            <label for="amount">Insured Amount (₹):</label>
            <input type="number" id="amount"
                   placeholder="Enter insured amount" min="1">

            <button onclick="calculatePremium()">
                Calculate Premium
            </button>

            <p id="result"></p>

            <button onclick="applyPolicy()">Apply for Policy</button>
            <p id="status"></p>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 InsureEasy</p>
    </footer>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>

